00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:43.890
Bukalah!

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:48.470
Nasib malang macam apa ni?

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.470
Walaupun dalam permainan, saya masih tidak bernasib baik.

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:16.520
-Berhenti!
-Berhenti!

